{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"0936cd01-4dc8-4463-aff7-4471c08fd730":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_JJqfKf":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"76021a34-f846-4d9a-9f11-1cd32771ffbf":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Our Very Cherry Moonshine offers a rich and full fruit flavour with fine vanilla notes. This one will transport you to long summer nights with the taste of freshly picked cherries from the garden. Perfect enjoyed on the rocks or as part of a cocktail.<\/p><p>You can find cocktail recipes, perfect to elevate your Very Cherry, on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/very-cherry\">cocktail page<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, with our Moonshines we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs,<\/a> have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and unlock unique benefits.<\/p><p><strong>Please note: All our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<p><strong>Very Cherry Cooler<\/strong><br\/><\/p><ul><li>50ml Very Cherry<\/li><li>Top with Cola<\/li><li>Fresh Lime Slices<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Add Very Cherry to a tall glass with some ice. Top with Cola and 2 slices of fresh lime.<\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/very-cherry\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/very-cherry\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"5568e6a6-3f26-4115-9bdc-9cebaa3dbf35":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}},"recommended_products_eCrmqk":{"type":"recommended_products","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Discover more moonshine","content":"","button_text":"","product_list":["blood-orange","passionfruit"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true}}},"block_order":["title","caption","0936cd01-4dc8-4463-aff7-4471c08fd730","price","description","variant_picker","da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_JJqfKf","76021a34-f846-4d9a-9f11-1cd32771ffbf","collapsible-row-2","collapsible-row-3","collapsible-row-1","5568e6a6-3f26-4115-9bdc-9cebaa3dbf35","collapsible-row-0","recommended_products_eCrmqk"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"3c3f5298-7cfd-47f2-944e-72284d026062":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16302824259715__3c3f5298-7cfd-47f2-944e-72284d026062-168509736468a50ac7-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"The Perfect Balance of Flavour","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16302824259715__3c3f5298-7cfd-47f2-944e-72284d026062-168509736468a50ac7-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>The bold and juicy flavour of fresh cherries, perfectly complimented by a subtle hint of vanilla offers the perfect balance of rich fruit flavours and sweet and notes (with a Moonshine kick)!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16302824259715__3c3f5298-7cfd-47f2-944e-72284d026062-168509736468a50ac7-0","template--16302824259715__3c3f5298-7cfd-47f2-944e-72284d026062-168509736468a50ac7-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Very_Cherry_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Multi Award-Winning","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>We are proud to share that our Very Cherry Flavour has won yet another award! From <strong>winning GOLD <\/strong>at the People's Choice Spirits awards 2025 to <strong>winning GOLD <\/strong>at Global Liqueur Masters 2024, the awards keep flowing in for this fruity favourite! Get in on the hype & discover Very Cherry today!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ProductImage_FreeVCMicrodeal.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":12,"padding_bottom":12}},"5eedcab9-3b7e-45ff-b865-4277975c305f":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16302824259715__5eedcab9-3b7e-45ff-b865-4277975c305f-16850973